#ASSERT `the appointee may carry on the business of the corporation within s 94` `a receiver appointed in respect of property of a corporation` FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT `the appointee may carry on the business of the corporation within s 94` `a sequestrator of property of a corporation` TRUE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT `the appointee may carry on the business of the corporation within s 94` `a sequestrator of property of a corporation` FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT `the appointee may carry on the business of the corporation within s 94` `a receiver-manager of a corporation` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the appointee may carry on the business of the corporation within s 94` `a receiver-manager of a corporation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 95`
-- args: the kind of appointee; the business is carried on to protect the security interest
